# No em-dash in user-facing text

Do not use the em-dash character (U+2014) in README files, release notes, About text, or other user-visible copy.

Use a hyphen `-`, a comma, or separate sentences instead.

HTML page titles may use ` - ` between app name and page name (hyphen with spaces), not an em-dash.
